{"unit_id":"tag:0AMB:proof","translation":"注意，这个陈述有意义，因为已将上同调群（cohomology groups）<MATH_0001>与<MATH_0002>均认同为<MATH_0003>，见引理<REF_0001>。事实上，若<MATH_0004>为次数（degree）<MATH_0005>的线丛（line bundle），它在<MATH_0006>上，其类（class）为<MATH_0007>，则<MATH_0008>的余边界（coboundary）为<MATH_0009>的生成元（generator）。这里的余边界（coboundary）是与 Kummer 列（sequence）关联的上同调（cohomology）长正合列（exact sequence）的余边界（coboundary）。因此，引理的结论由如下事实得到：线丛（line bundle）<MATH_0010>在<MATH_0011>上的次数（degree）为<MATH_0012>。一些细节从略。\n","allowed_english":["Kummer"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群"},{"source_term":"degree","target_term":"次数"},{"source_term":"line bundle","target_term":"线丛"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"coboundary","target_term":"余边界"},{"source_term":"generator","target_term":"生成元"},{"source_term":"coboundary","target_term":"余边界"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"列"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"exact sequence","target_term":"正合列"},{"source_term":"coboundary","target_term":"余边界"},{"source_term":"line bundle","target_term":"线丛"},{"source_term":"degree","target_term":"次数"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"degree","target_term":"次数","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"line bundle","target_term":"线丛","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"coboundary","target_term":"余边界","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"generator","target_term":"生成元","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"列","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"exact sequence","target_term":"正合列","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03RQ:proof","translation":"定理<REF_0001>及<REF_0002>确定了平展上同调（<ACCENT_0001>tale cohomology），即<MATH_0001>在<MATH_0002>上的相应群，其描述利用<MATH_0003>的 Picard 群（Picard group）。随后 Kummer 列（sequence）<MATH_0004>（引理<REF_0003>）给出长正合（exact）上同调（cohomology）列（sequence）\n<MATH_0005>\n。<MATH_0006>次幂映射（map）<MATH_0007>满射（surjective），因为<MATH_0008>代数闭（algebraically closed）。因此须计算映射（map）<MATH_0009>的核（kernel）及余核（cokernel）。考虑行正合（exact）的交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0010>\n。群（group）<MATH_0011>是<MATH_0012>-值点（points），所属群概形（group scheme）为<MATH_0013>，见《曲线（Curves）的 Picard 概形（Picard Schemes）》引理<REF_0004>。同一个引理表明<MATH_0014>是<MATH_0015>维（dimensional）的阿贝尔（abelian）簇（variety），它在<MATH_0016>上，其定义见群胚（Groupoids）定义<REF_0005>。因此，由群胚（Groupoids）命题<REF_0006>，左侧的竖直映射（map）满射（surjective）。应用蛇引理（snake lemma）即得到引理所述的典范（canonical）认同（identifications）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n为得到引理中的非典范（noncanonical）认同（identifications），须证明<MATH_0017>的核（kernel）同构于（isomorphic）<MATH_0018>。这也是群胚（Groupoids）命题<REF_0007>的一部分。\n","allowed_english":["Kummer","Picard"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale cohomology","target_term":"平展上同调"},{"source_term":"Picard group","target_term":"Picard 群"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"列"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"列"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"algebraically closed","target_term":"代数闭"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"cokernel","target_term":"余核"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"值点"},{"source_term":"group scheme","target_term":"群概形"},{"source_term":"Curves","target_term":"曲线"},{"source_term":"Picard Schemes","target_term":"Picard 概形"},{"source_term":"dimensional","targ